\title{Net flow}
\date{2026-11-16T18:46:24Z}
\tag{algorithms}

\import{algorithms-macros}

\taxon{Definition}
\p{The \em{net flow} of a [cut](00SO) #{(A,B)} with respect to a [flow](00RZ) #{f}, written #{v(A,B)}, is ##{\sum_{e : A \to B} f(e) - \sum_{e : B \to A}
  f(e),} the difference between the flow leaving #{A} and the flow entering #{A}. (We could thus call it #{A}’s “net exports”.)}

